                "text": "(CVE-2026-1225) ch.qos.logback:logback-core@1.4.14"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[ch.qos.logback:logback-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/ch.qos.logback/logback-core) is a logback-core module.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to External Initialization of Trusted Variables or Data Stores during the configuration file processing. An attacker can instantiate arbitrary classes already present on the class path by compromising an existing configuration file.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `ch.qos.logback:logback-core` to version 1.5.25 or higher.\n## References\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/qos-ch/logback/commit/d28931f3b9ede954285cd22d44e029142bba52e6)\n- [Logback Release Notes](https://logback.qos.ch/news.html#1.5.25)\n"
