            {
              "id": "SNYK-JAVA-ORGAPACHETOMCATEMBED-16691220",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Medium severity - Improper Validation of Syntactic Correctness of Input vulnerability in org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-41293) org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core@10.1.20"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Improper Validation of Syntactic Correctness of Input in the processing of HTTP/2 request headers. An attacker can cause unexpected behavior or potentially compromise the application by sending specially crafted HTTP/2 request headers.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.118, 10.1.55, 11.0.22 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Mailing List](https://lists.apache.org/thread/qwg0q16z7xkb2qrr853wdll5531mvl1r)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/1c70480466572c9192ed412ebefcd43fc63137fd)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/57c2b3bfd62792631e1df24cf4237b990a0b36fa)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/cf9452443bcbf3b1a4b435ef7d624364f1b65ca3)\n"
