              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Medium severity - Improper Handling of Case Sensitivity vulnerability in org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-43513) org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core@10.1.20"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Improper Handling of Case Sensitivity in the `LockOutRealm` function. An attacker can bypass account lockout protections by submitting usernames with different letter casing.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.118, 10.1.55, 11.0.22 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Mailing List](https://lists.apache.org/thread/ytjcgldshj73lcnd1sh95od5hrghwogp)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/6dd75beb55bd42fc5f78e929596b25018cd17717)\n"
