            {
              "id": "SNYK-JAVA-ORGAPACHETOMCATEMBED-17733813",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Critical severity - Missing Critical Step in Authentication vulnerability in org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-55957) org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core@10.1.20"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Missing Critical Step in Authentication in the `JNDIRealm` process when configured to authenticate binds using GSSAPI. An attacker can gain unauthorized access by bypassing password verification during authentication.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.101, 10.1.37, 11.0.5 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Mailing List](https://lists.apache.org/thread/7fk339o5jvd4mcgsf0chbrn4o525ccjh)\n- [Apache Tomcat Advisory](https://tomcat.apache.org/security-10.html)\n- [Apache Tomcat Advisory](https://tomcat.apache.org/security-11.html)\n- [Apache Tomcat Advisory](https://tomcat.apache.org/security-9.html)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/0cd21c0393b8811af22daddbba7b4e7328e2d79e)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/c32bbd37ea9ee0aaab848af4ee1c9a76e84240ea)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/fd96ab415631eea44636c94f911dd38427070ef9)\n"
