              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Always-Incorrect Control Flow Implementation due to the incomplete logging of the effective `web.xml` when special roles and empty authorization constraints are present. An attacker can bypass intended access restrictions by exploiting the absence of these constraints in the logged configuration.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.119, 10.1.56, 11.0.23 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Mailing List](https://lists.apache.org/thread/jy09xjlzn6r2qwvqoph8vcmf959yq68v)\n- [Apache Tomcat Advisory](https://tomcat.apache.org/security-10.html)\n- [Apache Tomcat Advisory](https://tomcat.apache.org/security-11.html)\n- [Apache Tomcat Advisory](https://tomcat.apache.org/security-9.html)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/25677f90fd721c26ef0f613d34ef8275b1aafc31)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/e391c6b201eae2ad9707a1335aff68ab8b3e0f84)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/f844614c6d92eeb11e81e179606bf4c390f642dd)\n"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
