            {
              "id": "SNYK-JAVA-ORGAPACHETOMCATEMBED-17734718",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Medium severity - Always-Incorrect Control Flow Implementation vulnerability in org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-53404) org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core@10.1.20"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.tomcat.embed/tomcat-embed-core) is a Core Tomcat implementation.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Always-Incorrect Control Flow Implementation due to incorrect control flow in the `RewriteValve` process. An attacker can bypass intended rewrite rules by crafting requests that exploit the improper evaluation of OR chains in conditions.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` to version 9.0.119, 10.1.56, 11.0.23 or higher.\n## References\n- [Apache Mailing List](https://lists.apache.org/thread/rdhpghgfskrdmw9hqzjgjrtw538smpmz)\n- [Apache Tomcat Advisory](https://tomcat.apache.org/security-10.html)\n- [Apache Tomcat Advisory](https://tomcat.apache.org/security-11.html)\n- [Apache Tomcat Advisory](https://tomcat.apache.org/security-9.html)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/b647cb584cea8bf95e64f5d2526c59ab8fca3225)\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/apache/tomcat/commit/bbb6219fa5ac185060bef7842cee5fb90230ca00)\n"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "CWE-670",
                  "maven"
                ],
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 6.9,
                "security-severity": "6.9"
              }
