                "security-severity": "9.1"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SNYK-JAVA-ORGSPRINGFRAMEWORK-19267099",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Medium severity - Open Redirect vulnerability in org.springframework:spring-webmvc"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "(CVE-2026-47887) org.springframework:spring-webmvc@6.1.6"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "## Overview\n[org.springframework:spring-webmvc](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.springframework/spring-webmvc) is a package that provides Model-View-Controller (MVC) architecture and ready components that can be used to develop flexible and loosely coupled web applications.\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Open Redirect in the `UrlFileNameViewController` file when it is mapped with an end-of-path and lacks a configured prefix. An attacker can redirect users to arbitrary external URLs by crafting a specially constructed request.\n## Remediation\nUpgrade `org.springframework:spring-webmvc` to version 7.0.9 or higher.\n## References\n- [GitHub Commit](https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-framework/commit/b9379e33d52b491e227715776a072d07bcccddab)\n- [Spring Security Advisory](https://spring.io/security/cve-2026-47887)\n"
